-- definitions.l4 — Diplomatic Appointments (Selection Process) Bill 2026 (Cth),
-- as introduced in the Senate (Senator Payman), 26S2721.
-- Part 1 — Preliminary: Division 1 (ss 1–5) and Division 2 (ss 6–8).
--
